.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-variable-delete \- Delete a variable for a project or group.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab variable delete  [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Deletes a variable by key. Use \fB--scope\fR to target a
variable in a specific environment, or \fB--group\fR to delete a group
variable instead.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-g\fP, \fB--group\fP=""
	Delete variable from a group.

.PP
\fB-s\fP, \fB--scope\fP="\fI"
	The 'environment_scope' of the variable. Options: all (\fP), or specific environments.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository. You can use either OWNER/REPO or GROUP/NAMESPACE/REPO. The full URL or Git URL is also accepted.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
glab variable delete VAR_NAME
glab variable delete VAR_NAME --scope=prod
glab variable delete VARNAME -g mygroup
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-variable(1)\fP
